    "summary": "When Habakkuk learns that the Lord will raise up the Chaldeans to overrun the land of Israel, he is troubled that the wicked can be thus employed.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "The burden which Habakkuk the prophet did see.",
