        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Habakkuk 1:4",
        "book": "Habakkuk",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold ye among the heathen, and regard, and wonder marvellously: for I will work a work in your days, which ye will not believe, though it be told you.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 84,
            "end": 88,
            "text": "Acts 13:41 (40–41)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 70,
            "end": 71
          },
          {
            "start": 103,
            "end": 108
          },
          {
            "start": 148,
            "end": 152
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Habakkuk 1:5",
        "book": "Habakkuk",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "For, lo, I raise up the Chaldeans, that bitter and hasty nation, which shall march through the breadth of the land, to possess the dwellingplaces that are not theirs.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 39
          },
          {
            "start": 146,
            "end": 154
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Habakkuk 1:6",
        "book": "Habakkuk",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "They are terrible and dreadful: their judgment and their dignity shall proceed of themselves.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 65,
            "end": 92,
            "text": "OR are of their own making."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 8
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Habakkuk 1:7",
        "book": "Habakkuk",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Their horses also are swifter than the leopards, and are more fierce than the evening wolves: and their horsemen shall spread themselves, and their horsemen shall come from far; they shall fly as the eagle that hasteth to eat.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 206,
            "end": 210
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Habakkuk 1:8",
        "book": "Habakkuk",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "They shall come all for violence: their faces shall sup up as the east wind, and they shall gather the captivity as the sand.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 99,
            "end": 112,
            "text": "OR captives."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 61
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Habakkuk 1:9",
        "book": "Habakkuk",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And they shall scoff at the kings, and the princes shall be a scorn unto them: they shall deride every strong hold; for they shall heap dust, and take it.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Habakkuk 1:10",
        "book": "Habakkuk",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Then shall his mind change, and he shall pass over, and offend, imputing this his power unto his god.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 19,
            "text": "TG Mind."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 11,
            "end": 14
          },
          {
            "start": 64,
            "end": 72
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Mind.",
            "prettyString": "TG Mind",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
